  "question": {
    "text": "Three numbers are chosen at random without replacement from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>}</mo></math>. The probability that their minimum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>, given that their maximum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>, is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be the event that maximum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> be the event that minimum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts></mfrac></math>&nbsp;(number less than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts></mfrac></math> (number greater than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Required probability</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
